# count: counts 100,000,000 down to 0, prints nothing. 400M steps. Benchmark.
# Prefix builds 10^8 (10, squared three times), then joins the ring by an
# on-ramp: the last blue sits behind the ring's red, so the ring never
# turns back into it.
#
#                     brown (exit)
#                        \
#                        pink --- orange
#                         |         |
#   red x10 ... blue -->  red ---- cyan
red      1000   300
red      2200   300
red      3400   300
red      4600   300
red      5800   300
red      7000   300
red      8200   300
red      9400   300
red     10600   300
red     11800   300
orange  13000   300
blue    14200   300
orange  15400   300
blue    16600   300
orange  17800   300
blue    19000   300
red     20450     0   # PUSH 1: n 1
cyan    21650     0   # SUB:    n-1
orange  21650  1200   # DUP:    n-1 n-1
pink    20450  1200   # >0 turn left to red, 0 straightest = brown
brown   19550  2300   # DROP the 0; dead end, halt
